OL,3,GNEWSAWinter flu vaccine rollout begins.
OL,4,AWho's eligible?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPregnant women, older people, and those
OL,7,Fwith underlying health conditions are
OL,8,Fbeing urged to get their flu jab as the
OL,9,Fwinter vaccination rollout begins.
OL,11,FLast year, almost 5,000 adults in
OL,12,FScotland were hospitalised as a result
OL,13,Fof flu, Public Health Scotland (PHS)
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FDr Claire Cameron, consultant in health
OL,17,Fprotection at PHS, said getting
OL,18,Fvaccinated was the best way to reduce
OL,19,Fthis number and keep yourself and
OL,20,Fothers safe.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
